DESCRIPTION:Do you have the experience or desire to tell stories and would like to be a storyteller at the Ithra Library? Every Wednesday\, you have the opportunity to read your favorite stories to the children\, nudge them to love books\, develop their passion for reading and stimulate their imagination.
